{"text":"正光三年七月十七日，大統寺大比丘慧榮造像一。願國祚永寧，上延亡二親，榮及姊妹。一切含生，速到岸，同證正覺。","tags":[{"name":"LocName","term":"大統寺","refId":null,"text":"大統寺","start":10,"end":13},{"name":"PersonName","term":"慧榮","refId":null,"text":"慧榮","start":16,"end":18},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"含生","start":41,"end":43},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彼岸","refId":null,"text":"到岸","start":45,"end":47},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"正覺","refId":null,"text":"正覺","start":50,"end":52}]}